msgctxt "92"
msgid "To the Ryudo office we go. C'mon, follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Mikio. Run on ahead and let the boss know we're comin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "You got it, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Hey, I wanted to ask you about that tattoo you have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "What about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"You said the viper's the symbol of Okinawa, right? Then\r\n"
"why'd you leave its eyes blank?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Oh, well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"My tattoo guy ended up passing away before he could get all\r\n"
"the finishing touches in. So I decided to just leave it that\r\n"
"way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Can't you get someone else to finish the job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I mean, I've thought about it and all... but I dunno if\r\n"
"some random other artist could do his work justice.\r\n"
"Wouldn't really feel right, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"And with how important the viper is, I gotta have someone\r\n"
"who's real in-tune with the soul of Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Haven't found anyone like that since my old guy died,\r\n"
"though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Knowing Okinawa has nothing to do with it. The best tattoo\r\n"
"artists know how to best reflect a man's soul, no matter the\r\n"
"theme."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "A master artist should be able to do your viper justice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Well then I hope I can find one someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"The world's a big place. I'm sure you'll come across someone\r\n"
"sooner or later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Yeah, you might be right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Anyway, we should get movin'. The boss'll be waiting for us."
msgstr ""

